@{ var storefront = User.IsInRole(Roles.Customer) || (User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated != true && ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString() == "Orders"); var current = ViewContext.RouteData.Values["controller"]?.ToString(); var manager = User.IsInRole(Roles.Manager); var customer = User.IsInRole(Roles.Customer); }
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] · ShopManager</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body class="@(storefront ? "storefront" : null)">
@if (storefront)
{
    <header class="shop-header no-print">
        <nav class="shop-header-inner" aria-label="Cửa hàng">
            <a class="brand" asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Create"><span class="brand-icon">S</span> ShopManager</a>
            <div class="shop-nav">
                <a asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Create">Sản phẩm</a>
                @if (customer)
                {
                    <a asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Index">Đơn của tôi</a>
                    <a asp-controller="Assistant" asp-action="Shop">Tư vấn AI</a>
                    <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="ChangePassword">Đổi mật khẩu</a>
                    <form asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" method="post"><button class="logout" type="submit">Đăng xuất</button></form>
                }
                else
                {
                    <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Login">Đăng nhập</a>
                }
                <a class="shop-cart-link" asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Create" asp-route-cartOnly="true">Giỏ hàng <span id="shop-cart-count" class="count-pill" hidden>0</span></a>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>
}
else if (User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated == true)
{
    <aside class="sidebar no-print">
        <a class="brand" asp-controller="@(customer ? "Orders" : "Home")" asp-action="@(customer ? "Create" : "Index")"><span class="brand-icon">S</span><span>ShopManager<small>@(customer ? "MUA HÀNG" : "QUẢN LÝ CỬA HÀNG")</small></span></a>
        <div class="workspace"><span class="live-dot"></span> Cửa hàng của bạn <small>Không gian làm việc</small></div>
        <p class="nav-label">@(customer ? "MUA HÀNG" : "ĐIỀU HÀNH")</p>
        <nav aria-label="Điều hướng chính">
            @if (customer)
            {
                <a asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Create"><span>▦</span> Mua hàng</a>
                <a asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Create" asp-route-cartOnly="true">Giỏ hàng</a>
                <a asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Index"><span>▤</span> Đơn của tôi</a>
            }
            else
            {
            @if (manager) { <a class="@(current == "Home" ? "active" : "")" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index"><span>◫</span> Tổng quan</a> }
            <a class="@(current == "Orders" ? "active" : "")" asp-controller="Orders" asp-action="Index"><span>▤</span> Đơn hàng</a>
            <a class="@(current == "Products" ? "active" : "")" asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Index"><span>▦</span> Sản phẩm</a>
            @if (manager) {
                <a class="@(current == "Categories" ? "active" : "")" asp-controller="Categories" asp-action="Index"><span>▱</span> Danh mục</a>
                <a class="@(current == "Inventory" ? "active" : "")" asp-controller="Inventory" asp-action="Index"><span>⇄</span> Kho hàng</a>
            }
            <a class="@(current == "Customers" ? "active" : "")" asp-controller="Customers" asp-action="Index"><span>♧</span> Khách hàng</a>
            @if (manager) { <a asp-controller="Assistant" asp-action="Manage"><span>✦</span> Trợ lý AI</a> }
            @if (manager) { <a class="@(current == "Staff" ? "active" : "")" asp-controller="Staff" asp-action="Index"><span>♙</span> Nhân viên</a> }
            }
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-bottom"><span class="role-pill">@(manager ? "Quản lý" : customer ? "Khách hàng" : "Nhân viên")</span><a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="ChangePassword">Đổi mật khẩu</a><form asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" method="post"><button class="logout" type="submit">Đăng xuất ↗</button></form></div>
    </aside>
}
<div class="@(storefront ? "shop-shell" : User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated == true ? "app-shell" : "guest-shell")">
    @if (!storefront && User.Identity?.IsAuthenticated == true) {
        <header class="topbar no-print"><div class="breadcrumb-text">Cửa hàng <span>/</span> @ViewData["Title"]</div><div class="topbar-right"><span class="today">@VietnamTime.Today.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")</span><span class="avatar">@(manager ? "QL" : customer ? "KH" : "NV")</span></div></header>
    }
    <main>
        @if (TempData["Success"] is string success) { <div class="alert alert-success" role="status">@success</div> }
        @if (TempData["Error"] is string error) { <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">@error</div> }
        @RenderBody()
    </main>
    <footer class="app-footer no-print">ShopManager <span>•</span> @(storefront ? "Thanh toán khi nhận hàng" : "Quản lý đơn giản, bán hàng thuận tiện.")</footer>
</div>
<script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
@await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
